    "description": "<div>Currently there are almost 100 GIS data files available for free download in shapefile (.zip), DWG and KML format. Please note that use of this data may require some proficiency in GIS and accessibility to GIS software.</div><div>All files are US Feet, North American Datum 1983 (NAD83), State Plane Coordinate System Florida East (FIPS Zone 0901).</div><div>Due to the large size of the file, orthophotography is not available for download, but can be purchased for a fee.</div><div><br /></div><div><font size='3'><span style='font-family: &quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>To learn more please contact the\u00a0</span><a href='mailto:gis@miamidade.gov?subject=Address%20Search' style='color: rgb(0, 121, 193); text-decoration-line: none; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);' target='_blank'>GIS Technical Support Group</a></font><br /></div>",
